// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4132655327" "The Reflections seem to echo the villains of other worlds exactly. The Reflections of the Council robots are disciplined, alert fighters, ever responsive to the orders of their masters."
// DisplayNames :
"P994528948" "Zenith Mech Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
