// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Reflections_Thorn_Wielder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P886640550" "The Reflections seem to be exact copies of the terrors that exist on other worlds. It is unknown whether these mystics are Reflections of Paragon City's Circle of Thorns, or of the Oranbegans from some other dimension. What is certain is that they fight with the same utter disregard for life that Paragon City's heroes have witnessed many a time."
// DisplayNames :
"P3031096203" "Thorn Wielder"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Reflections_Thorn_Fire_Caster 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
